oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxYWbF_qCabSC5Q5CvfIJFVwYDAnvclXc17iy3F3hf1tQ&oe=69BD2EA3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "screen3.png", "id": "458598088952441", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974871_458598092285774_5159038276755156810_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lzg8ja0AUdUQ7kNvwGZwWnD&_nc_oc=AdkEsql4wHZYVAgIndk6NdgxDnQnhWGlOYyrjQlfiF7p4KCHzr036XPFfFQWKMSsck4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw7yrEF861YJOg3cacToq-tq_Vvo7OjliOT1EymcBWA3A&oe=69BD5E17"}, "display_name": "ZOSULand 20ZZ", "keywords": ["Parkour", "jetpack", "cyberpunk", "Climb", "City"], "long_description": "Zany ZOSULand Experience\n\nClimb, fly, grapple over 10 square miles / 28 kilometers of futuristic urban areas in order to save each floating city and the multitude of animals from the invading forces.\n\nOctober 2024 Update: added setting change option for Quest3 or higher device, various performance improvements also made.\n\n- 27 unique city levels + 9 bonus levels to fly through space \n- Over 250 building types to explore and over 40 types of animals to save\n- Jetpacks allow flight, grapples in each level available, and you can climb almost anything anywhere\n- Destroy robots and dinosaurs\n- Motion Sickness Consideration: all horizontal turning can be done using the right joystick in addition to the direction you are looking, while flying move in direction of hand/jetpack.\n*Additional 5/23/2022 updates: major game mechanics improvements, new random level selector, level end-scenes with score and animal viewing, added multiple songs, added new animal spawns / animations and some random spawns*", "short_description": "-Zany ZOSULand Experience:\n-Climb, fly, grapple over 10 miles / 28 kilometers of futuristic urban areas to save each floating city and the multitude of animals\n- 27 unique city levels + 9 bonus levels\n- Over 250 building types to explore, over 40 types of animals t